<title>POLAND: Polish bank Pekao earmarks PLN 24.5 mln for payout.</title>
<headline>Polish bank Pekao earmarks PLN 24.5 mln for payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's treasury decided that the fully state-owned bank Pekao SA will earmark 24.5 million zlotys of last year's 243.4-million-zloty net profit for dividend, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bank said it would earmark 159.4 million zlotys for reserve funds, 25 million for the risk fund and 34.5 million for the employee fund.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
